<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Bon {{ $payment->reference }}</title>
<style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f3f4f6;color:#202733;font:15px Arial,sans-serif}.voucher{max-width:760px;margin:30px auto;padding:36px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9dee5}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;border-bottom:2px solid #197b25;padding-bottom:18px}.brand{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#197b25}.muted{color:#687386}.ref{text-align:right}.ref strong{display:block}.title{margin:28px 0 6px;font-size:25px}.amount{margin:24px 0;padding:18px;background:#f4f8f4;border:1px solid #dce9dc;font-size:25px;font-weight:800;color:#197b25}.facts{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.facts td{padding:11px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e8ec}.facts td:first-child{color:#687386;width:42%}.signatures{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:30px;margin-top:48px}.signature{min-height:105px;border-top:1px solid #9ca5af;padding-top:9px}.actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin:18px auto;max-width:760px}.actions button{padding:10px 16px;background:#197b25;color:white;border:0;border-radius:4px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:600px){.voucher{margin:0;padding:22px 16px}.top{display:block}.ref{text-align:left;margin-top:14px}.signatures{gap:18px}}@media print{body{background:#fff}.voucher{margin:0 auto;border:0}.actions{display:none}}</style></head>
<body><article class="voucher"><header class="top"><div><div class="brand">TENACOS</div><div class="muted">Bon interne de remise d’espèces</div></div><div class="ref"><strong>{{ $payment->reference }}</strong><span>{{ $payment->paid_at?->format('d/m/Y') }}</span></div></header>
<h1 class="title">{{ $payment->kind==='advance'?'Avance sur salaire':'Versement de salaire' }}</h1><p>Remise enregistrée pour le mois de <strong>{{ $payment->period->period_start->translatedFormat('F Y') }}</strong>.</p><div class="amount">{{ number_format($payment->amount,0,',',' ') }} F CFA</div>
<table class="facts"><tr><td>Employé</td><td><strong>{{ $payment->period->employee->name }}</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Salaire mensuel convenu</td><td>{{ number_format($payment->period->salary_amount,0,',',' ') }} F CFA</td></tr><tr><td>Mode</td><td>Espèces · caisse générale</td></tr><tr><td>Référence de remise</td><td>{{ $payment->payment_reference ?: $payment->reference }}</td></tr><tr><td>Enregistré par</td><td>{{ $payment->payer->name }}</td></tr></table>
<p class="muted" style="margin-top:18px">Ce bon confirme qu’un versement en espèces a été déclaré comme effectué. Il ne constitue pas un bulletin de paie et ne calcule aucune retenue légale.</p><div class="signatures"><div class="signature">Signature de l’employé</div><div class="signature">Signature du payeur</div></div></article><div class="actions"><button onclick="window.print()">Imprimer le bon</button></div></body></html>
